        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert John Bardo, Rebecca Schaeffer\n- Events: murder of Rebecca Schaeffer, conviction of Robert John Bardo\n- Topics: stalking, life imprisonment without parole\n\nFacts:\n- Rebecca Schaeffer was an American model and actress who was born on November 6, 1967, and died on July 18, 1989.\n- Robert John Bardo was born on January 2, 1970, and is an American man.\n- Robert John Bardo stalked Rebecca Schaeffer for three years before her death.\n- Robert John Bardo murdered Rebecca Schaeffer on July 18, 1989.\n- Robert John Bardo was convicted in October 1991 for the murder of Rebecca Schaeffer.\n- Robert John Bardo is serving life imprisonment without parole for the murder of Rebecca Schaeffer.",
